  "solution": [
    "Total cakes: \\(3 \\cdot 2 + 4 \\cdot 3 + 5 \\cdot 4 + 6 \\cdot 1 = 6 + 12 + 20 + 6 = 44\\).",
    "There are 10 days, so the mean is \\(\\frac{44}{10} = 4.4\\)."
